    "title": "OPINION: Christ Church draws attention on campus - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By AJ Pearman ,\n4 hours ago The University of Idaho prides itself on being a place where diverse ideas can be explored freely, but one organization’s involvement on campus continues to stir debate about religion, free speech and inclusion. Christ Church, a conservative Christian congregation based in Moscow, has become a topic of contention for many students due to its active presence on campus through the student group Collegiate Reformed Fellowship. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
